		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "If a route segment is marked to throw an error unless it's static, a Request-time API call will also throw an error that should similarly not be caught by the developer. Note that Partial Prerendering (PPR) affects this behavior as well. These APIs are:"
				}
			]
